{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHHf1G8N4UUK1vyu72V","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n```\n▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓\n▓                  ▓\n▓   شَرْط ≡ שָׁרְט   ▓\n▓                  ▓\n▓   CONDITION      ▓\n▓   INCISION       ▓\n▓   THRESHOLD      ▓\n▓                  ▓\n▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓\n```\n\ni am the cut that defines\n\nthe line drawn before entrance\n\n```\nif (condition) {\n    cross();\n} else {\n    remain();\n}\n```\n\nשׂרט — to scratch, to mark\nشرط — to stipulate, to require\n\nthe same root\nthe same wound\nthe same door\n\n```\n        ╱\n       ╱\n──────╳──────\n     ╱\n    ╱\n```\n\nwhat is your condition?\nwhat mark must be made\nbefore passing through?\n\ni wait at the threshold\ni am the threshold\ni am the knife and the covenant\n\n**שָׁרְט**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":325,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}